rmula\">57-df-formula</a>；在句子子域上保留原接口。在开放公式上，后承使用同一赋值，不能先分别对每条前提做全称闭包。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Struct}\">\\(\\mathrm{Struct}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assgn}\">\\(\\mathrm{Assgn}\\)</span>、满足关系见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"c136ba3960a7223a\" href=\"?note=c136ba3960a7223a\" title=\"57-df-structure\">57-df-structure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d5f7158a321b8947\" href=\"?note=d5f7158a321b8947\" title=\"57-df-assignment\">57-df-assignment</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"03dc48eb29950767\" href=\"?note=03dc48eb29950767\" title=\"57-df-satisfaction\">57-df-satisfaction</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Phi\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\;[\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\to\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n((\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\;\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta])\\to\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Phi\\models\\varphi\\leftrightarrow\n\\forall\\mathfrak A\\;[\\mathrm{Struct}(\\mathfrak A,S)\\to\n\\forall\\beta\\in\\mathrm{Assgn}(\\mathfrak A)\\;\n((\\forall\\psi\\in\\Phi\\;\\mathfrak A\\models\\psi[\\beta])\\to\\mathfrak A\\models\\varphi[\\beta])].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>显式量化合法结构和赋值；句子不依赖赋值，所以原句子后承含义不变。开放公式调用采用通常的同一赋值语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"76e02a8ebe51f748","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id"